<!--/Post: 6035-->
<!--Post: 6956--><!--Time: 1108091902-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6956"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 7:18 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->How on earth is it possible for the WPD to find the man hours it would have to take to follow each and every lead. Really, think about it! Have you all looked at all the theories posted throughout each board in here. Wow! I think I&#39;ll quit my job, go back home and volunteer to help these guys out. I&#39;m no expert, but maybe some small way.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6956-->
<!--Post: 6988--><!--Time: 1108108889-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6988"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Armchairpi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Armchairpi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 12:01 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->fwiw, just thought this might mean something to people interested in this thread: <BR>&#34;BTK&#34; in &#34;Messages from BTK&#34; thread: <BR> <BR><b>Posted on Sunday, February 06, 2005 - 10:47 pm: <BR>-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------ <BR>fbi...wpd...CIA are a grave joke. to solve this mystery one n ee ds to educate thy self</b><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6988-->
<!--Post: 7002--><!--Time: 1108121427-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7002"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Whoisbtk<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Whoisbtk<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 3:30 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Catcher <BR> <BR>I don&#39;t know if they&#39;re watching graves on anniversary dates, but WPD is watching the Otero home. <BR>  <BR>I went to Edgemoor park 2/10/05 to research playgrounds and sidewalks as they existed in 1974.  After half an hour of walking around the park with a camera, looking at 803 Edgemoor, I went back to my car and found one unmarked surveillance unit in the recreation center parking lot, and a marked patrol unit two blocks away.  Watching my car. <BR> <BR>It looks like they&#39;re putting in the manpower. <BR> <BR><a href="mailto:whoisbtk@yahoo.com">whoisbtk@yahoo.com</a> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7002-->
<!--Post: 7025--><!--Time: 1108137999-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7025"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 8:06 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I do think that he pops in for visits, particularly Vicki&#39;s, if she is buried locally. She looks so much like his beloved &#34;?&#34;, IMO.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7025-->
<!--Post: 7055--><!--Time: 1108156577-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7055"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Haytrader<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Haytrader<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 1:16 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Armchairpi, <BR>Posted on Sunday, February 06, 2005 - 10:47 pm:  <BR>-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------  <BR>fbi...wpd...CIA are a grave joke. to solve this mystery one n ee ds to educate thy self <BR> <BR>Reading that:   educate=school <BR>                    thy=biblical <BR> <BR>Are there any religious schools in Wichita? <BR>;&#41;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
