<!--Post: 7060--><!--Time: 1108160229-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7060"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Affie4u<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Affie4u<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 2:17 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Why I am not surprised that a unmarked car is watching the otero home? Gosh, what do they think, that BTK Will show up there Or a kid might try to look in a window? I bet the people who live there must be going nuts with everything.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
